{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1609.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"f38ce311646ce882b93726d69b8902d9e39768fa3761b6f5c10803c0b114229e","ja":"お疲れさまなの～☆\nねぇねぇ莉緒、これ見てみて。","zh":"辛苦啦～☆\n我说莉绪，你快看这个。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1609.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"368339b0c82ee5f7dffcd7f784e7bba559ae37c9e5581f742566408cb5af749c","ja":"ネット記事？　なにかしら……\n「地雷系ファッションには、この香水がマスト」？","zh":"网络文章？写了些什么呢……\n“地雷系时尚必备这款香水”？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1609.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"06d1d58431449037660ce1264c9a41b4f06d322895e4d33f84136c6ef4219d1b","ja":"これ、今すっごくバズッてるんだって。\n香りを自分で選べるショップだよ。","zh":"这个好像现在超级火呢。\n是可以自己挑选香味的店哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1609.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"6ea6bad706c43d93a145aeb0d0ff26fa03b123cb849e521e5f07fc0077063eec","ja":"聞いたことあるわ。香りを自由に組み合わせて、\nオリジナルの香水を作れるところがあるって。","zh":"我听说过呢。据说有地方可以自由搭配香味，\n调制出属于自己的原创香水。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1609.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"9ed3f1396db7c192c7d44a619ae050f6b7fed5bea7c3f6f5289db10568d9fa8a","ja":"そうなの。で、この記事に配合とかが\n載ってるんだけど……。","zh":"是这样。然后，这篇文章里写了\n配方什么的……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1609.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"b4a55bf671b72e8b6c4defe8f433700afea78b08572ec99ca08a8355942576a9","ja":"地雷系ファッションにぴったりな香りがあるん\nだって。今から確かめに行かない？","zh":"听说有特别适合地雷系穿搭的香气哦。\n现在要不要去确认一下？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1609.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"2ce7b37e3db8eed255b86c39210a0d6a1686e3d34dd4442255de82975f62c6a3","ja":"いいわね！　タイムリーな話題だし、\n気になってたお店だから、ちょうどいいわ！","zh":"挺好的呢！正合时下的话题，\n而且我也挺在意那家店的，正合适！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1609.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"80222874f23ae5f0721ab4fcea4578d5d551c615fff7631df7c92eadbc5f3efa","ja":"それじゃあ、出発なの☆","zh":"那么，出发喽☆","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1609.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"7828962c024efaecfec68e1707300313ad2cd604d86f9405dc0ec429e399aceb","ja":"ここね。お店に入っただけで、いい香りがしてるわね。\nなんだかワクワクしちゃうわ♪","zh":"就是这里呢。刚一进店，就能闻到一阵香气呢。\n总觉得有些兴奋起来了呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1609.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"8f892fffa5b104dea56b78895c45dd461776c22ccd3e37f0d690e8b9add423a7","ja":"えっと……「30種類以上ある香りから、\n4つまで選択して配合できます」。","zh":"那个……“可以从30种以上的香气中，\n最多选择4种进行调配”。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1609.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"889fed72280a17bd4e31cec95c29cbbe0d0af1336ed0b1a755ff622ecba80394","ja":"いっぱいあるんだね。\nどれを混ぜてみようかな～。","zh":"种类真多呢。\n该把哪些混在一起好呢～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1609.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"618ebc3c22d8075694f2e1a705e7bcbc06e512cdf2bffa98bff04e16e0950ccd","ja":"まずは、記事で見た配合を試してみましょ。\nえっと……これと、これと……。","zh":"先来试试报道里看到的配方吧。\n唔……这个，还有这个……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
